# The one place the CI image is pinned. Read by fast-lane.yml and slow-lane.yml
# (via their `resolve-image` job), never duplicated into a `container:` literal.
#
# A007-T16: this MUST be a digest pin (`...@sha256:...`), not a moving tag.
#
# BOOTSTRAP STATE — the image has not been published to GHCR yet, so there is no
# digest to pin. Until `ci-image.yml` runs on `main` once and produces a digest:
#   * this points at the `:main` tag
#   * the `resolve-image` job emits a loud warning on every run
#   * A007-T16 is NOT yet satisfied for the CI image (tracked: FDN-55 Stage 3
#     hand-off note)
# First follow-up after the image publishes: replace the line below with
#   CI_IMAGE=ghcr.io/shaheerjameel17/vulto-for-professional-services/ci@sha256:<digest>
CI_IMAGE=ghcr.io/shaheerjameel17/vulto-for-professional-services/ci:main
